        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 766456c17ec26d970a8f84cb3685b24d0297a8a6\nparent 19128e8b77553e4362fcbf3cb8f3f7dc5a2e4253\nauthor Enoch Azariah <enirox001@gmail.com> 1795279397 +0100\ncommitter Enoch Azariah <enirox001@gmail.com> 1795289563 +0100\n\nmining: handle negative and NaN waitTipChanged timeouts\n\nWait timeouts can come from an IPC client, so they should not be\nchecked with Assume. Negative and Nan values aborted debug builds\nin waitTipChanged, and NaN also passed the clamps in release builds\n\nTreat negative and Nan timeouts as zero in waitTipChanged and\nwaitNext, document and add functional test\n",
